Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get them to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruce ordered poems, but I can't get them right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The images speak for themselves; the last words won't fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help? Or must you go right now?
